## 📋 **Core TaskMaster Commands**

### Parse PRD Command
```bash
# Parse requirements document
task-master parse-prd --input="requirements.md" --research

# Parse with specific format
task-master parse-prd --input="{{project.name}}-requirements.txt" --format=structured --research

# Parse with context injection
task-master parse-prd --input="prd.md" --context="{{project.type}}" --research --output=tasks.json
```

**Expected Output**:
```json
{
  "project_info": {
    "name": "{{project.name}}",
    "complexity_score": 7.5,
    "estimated_duration": "2-3 weeks",
