## 🚨 **Troubleshooting TaskMaster**

### Common Issues

#### API Key Authentication
```bash
# Verify API keys
task-master verify-keys

# Test Perplexity connection
task-master test --service=perplexity

# Test Claude connection  
task-master test --service=anthropic
```

#### Performance Issues
```bash
# Clear TaskMaster cache
task-master cache --clear

# Reduce research depth
task-master config set research_depth minimal

# Optimize configuration
task-master optimize-config
```

#### Task Parsing Errors
```bash
# Validate PRD format
task-master validate-prd --input="requirements.md"

# Debug parsing issues
task-master parse-prd --debug --input="requirements.md"

# Use alternative parsing strategy
task-master parse-prd --strategy=fallback --input="requirements.md"
```

